Sorry for the delay on getting to this thread.

yes, put quotes around the paths with spaces in them.

Try the following:
1. open R and run (you may need to log in as an administrator):
install.packages(c("rJava","iplots","JGR","Deducer","JavaGD"),lib="C:/Program Files/R/R-3.0.1/library")

2. Try double clicking on jgr-1_62-x64.exe. If you get an error GOTO 3.

3. delete the hidden preference .JGRprefsrc and .JGREditorprefsrc in your home directory. These will not be visible, so you'll need to delete them using the command prompt. Open the command prompt (you should default to being in your home directory) and run
rm .JGRprefsrc
rm .JGREditorprefsrc

As I mentioned, I'm working on a more general solution which will hopefully be available in the near future.

ian

